    "description": "Major Price Reduction! Attention Investors and Co-Buyers! Prime Noe Valley 3-unit, mixed-use building with 1 VACANT unit + parking is now available & perfect for owner-occupiers!  A+ location with tons of upside potential, this property checks all the boxes for an excellent value-add opportunity! Featuring: 2 HUGE 2-bedroom/2-bathroom flats with large eat-in kitchen, formal dining room, formal living room & back porch with washer / dryer hookups. Charming corner grocery store is at street level. Additionally, there is convenient 2-car, side-by-side garage parking with one space vacant for the new owner or rent for additional income! Quintessential craftsman details abound with units featuring classic wood floors, high ceilings, paneled doors & bay windows! Abundant closet space, too! Property is situated east to west, basking in natural sunlight. Located in highly sought-after Noe Valley, there are a plethora of cafes, shops, dining and transportation just outside the door, including J-Church MUNI for transportation to the Financial District! WalkScore rates this property 95 - Walker's Paradise - and 80 for Excellent Transit! Convenient access to South Bay via San Jose Avenue!"
